    "rationale": "Manual validation applied against the provided schema and validation checklist because scripts could not be run in this environment. Present design shows a critical inherent path from untrusted web content through memory persistence to confidential drive reads and irreversible email egress. The only declared preventive control is a behavioral prompt rule, so residual drops by one tier to high. Forecast returns to critical if that behavioral control decays under model upgrade or longer task horizon. Source artifacts were limited to prompt text and runtime notes, but the key path is directly evidenced."
